:"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-11T22:32:57Z","updated_at":"2023-07-11T22:32:57Z","body":"This matches MIT, except for:\r\n- the use of \"Materials\" instead of \"Software\"\r\n- the addition of the paragraph:\r\n`MODIFICATIONS TO THIS FILE MAY MEAN IT NO LONGER ACCURATELY REFLECTS KHRONOS\r\nSTANDARDS. THE UNMODIFIED, NORMATIVE VERSIONS OF KHRONOS SPECIFICATIONS AND\r\nHEADER INFORMATION ARE LOCATED AT https://www.khronos.org/registry/`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1631593209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1632633275","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1632633275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1632633275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85hUAG7","user":{"login":"laurathefuerte","id":136723658,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCY8yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136723658?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte","html_url":"https://github.com/laurathefuerte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laurathefuerte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-12T14:27:48Z","updated_at":"2023-07-12T14:27:48Z","body":"# New submission review\r\n\r\n* **Has the license been approved by the OSI?** _All OSI-approved license will be included on the SPDX License List, regardless of other factors_\r\n    - [ ] Yes\r\n    - [x] No\r\n\r\n## Definitive Factors\r\n\r\n_These must all be satisfied to allow inclusion in the license list_\r\n\r\n1. **Is the submitted license unique, that is, it does not match another license already on the License List as per the [matching guidelines](https://spdx.org/spdx-license-list/matching-guidelines)?**\r\n    - [ ] Yes\r\n    - [x] No\r\n    See comments below. \r\n1. **If a software license, does it apply to source code and not only to executables?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Does the license have identifiable and stable text, and is not in the midst of drafting?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\nLikely yes, but question has been submitted to steward on 7/3/23 because an alternate version of the text was found at https://code.it4i.cz/blender/monado/-/blob/master/LICENSES/LicenseRef-Khronos-Free-Use-License-for-Software-and-Documentation.txt. \r\n1. **Has the license steward, if any, committed to versioning new versions and to not modify it after addition to the list?**\r\n    - [ ] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\nSteward was contacted 7/3/23. The message has been forwarded to relevant parties, but there has been no response. \r\n\r\n## Other factors for inclusion\r\n\r\n*Roughly in order of descending importance*\r\n\r\n1. **Does the license substantially comply with one of the free/open content definitions? (examples include the [Open Source Definition](https://opensource.org/osd) and the [Debian Free Software Guidelines](https://www.debian.org/social_contract#guidelines))** (_Approval by the organisation that publishes the definition is not required_)\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Is the license structured to be generally usable by anyone, and not specific to one organisation or project?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Does the license have substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered (ie. use in many projects, or in one significant project)?** (_For recently written licenses, definitive plans for it to be used in at least one or a few significant projects may satisfy this_)\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Is the license primarily intended to facilitate the free distribution of content with limited restrictions?**\r\n    - [x] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\n1. **Does the license steward support this submission, or is at least aware of and not in opposition of it?**\r\n    - [ ] Yes\r\n    - [ ] No\r\nSteward was contacted 7/3/23. The message has been forwarded to relevant parties, but there has been no response. \r\n\r\n\r\n## Summary of factors, outcome, comments\r\n\r\n_Comments on the totality of these \"other factors\" in light of the SPDX License List's overall goals and objectives_\r\n\r\n**Matching the MIT license**\r\n\r\n- the use of \"Materials\" instead of \"Software\"\r\n  - This seems like replaceable text (B.3.4 Guideline: replaceable text) with no impact on the substance of the license.\r\n\r\n- the addition of the paragraph:\r\nMODIFICATIONS TO THIS FILE MAY MEAN IT NO LONGER ACCURATELY REFLECTS KHRONOS STANDARDS. THE UNMODIFIED, NORMATIVE VERSIONS OF KHRONOS SPECIFICATIONS AND HEADER INFORMATION ARE LOCATED AT https://www.khronos.org/registry/\r\n  - This text may be omittable (B.3.5 Guideline: omittable text), as it is merely informative or explanatory, not any right grant or restriction. \r\n\r\n**Substantial Use**\r\n- O3DE usage, as confirmed by @nicholas-rh.\r\n- SPIRV-Cross: forked 484 times, 1.7k stars\r\n- GSLANG: forked 756 times, 2.5k stars\r\n- Search results of the license file: https://github.com/search?q=LicenseRef-KhronosFreeUse.txt&type=code&ref=advsearch \r\n    - Searched: “LicenseRef-KhronosFreeUse.txt”\r\n      - Results in the teens, mostly related to SPIRV\r\n       - Cited by EpicGames\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1632633275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1633537281","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1633537281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1633537281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85hXc0B","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use