:13Z","updated_at":"2023-07-13T16:30:13Z","body":"discussed on 7/13 call Steve's approach of adding markup to regular MIT for materials v. software (assuming this is only change) and adding MIT-Khronos for variant with extra paragraph, pending discussion with license steward to close that loop and make sure they are aware.  @laurathefuerte  to add @jlovejoy  to email thread with steward","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634545852/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1724154563","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1724154563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1724154563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85mxILD","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-18T18:28:43Z","updated_at":"2023-09-18T18:28:43Z","body":"Here's a header file that doesn't have the admonition paragraph:\r\nhttps://sourceforge.net/p/mingw-w64/mingw-w64/ci/master/tree/mingw-w64-headers/include/GL/glext.h\r\n(cc: @berrange)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1724154563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736487878","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1736487878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1736487878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ngLPG","user":{"login":"Conan-Kudo","id":276796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3Njc5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo","html_url":"https://github.com/Conan-Kudo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conan-Kudo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-27T00:43:00Z","updated_at":"2023-09-27T00:43:00Z","body":"I think it would make sense to call it `Khronos` rather than `MIT-Khronos`. Even though it's an MIT variant, it doesn't call itself the MIT license at all and is clearly a larger purpose license.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736487878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736611861","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1736611861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1736611861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ngpgV","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-27T03:20:22Z","updated_at":"2023-09-27T03:20:22Z","body":"I have pinged the Khronos Group as to the two variants: \r\n\r\n1) a match to MIT but for use of \"Materials\" instead of \"Software\" as seen here https://github.com/KhronosGroup/WebGL/blob/main/LICENSE.txt (and which Khronos does refer to as \"MIT\" if you look at https://github.com/KhronosGroup/WebGL/blob/main/README.md\r\n\r\n2) is a match to the above, but adds another clause in the middle, as seen here: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Cross/blob/main/LICENSES/LicenseRef-KhronosFreeUse.txt\r\n\r\n(note SPDX and Reuse compliant use of Licnese-Ref)\r\n\r\nMy inclination is we need both and that 2 is distinct. I'm contemplating if we could add one license for Khronos that accommodates both (separate from adding markup to MIT) and mark the middle clause as optional. I'm hoping some insight as to why they have these two variants may help guide us.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1736611861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738328937","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1738328937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1738328937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85nnMtp","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-09-28T01:53:27Z","updated_at":"2023-09-28T01:53:27Z","body":"I don't think I explicitly endorsed marking the language in question as a non-substantive variant of MIT so here it is.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738328937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1820277907","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017#issuecomment-1820277907","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2017","id":1820277907,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85sfzyT","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-21T05:44:09Z","updated_at":"2023-11-21T05:44:09Z","body":"Any progress here?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reacti